<section class="landing-journey" aria-label="From an idea to school progress" data-sf-stagger>
 <div class="landing-journey-heading"><svg class="workspace-svg" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ws-message"/></svg><span>A little feedback.<br><strong>A better campus.</strong></span></div>
 <ol><li data-sf-reveal="slide-up"><span class="landing-step-icon"><svg class="workspace-svg" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ws-message"/></svg></span><div><strong>Start with your idea</strong><p>Describe a change that would help.</p></div><span class="landing-step-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span></li><li data-sf-reveal="slide-up"><span class="landing-step-icon"><svg class="workspace-svg" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ws-shield"/></svg></span><div><strong>Your school reviews it</strong><p>Staff consider it and may ask a question.</p></div><span class="landing-step-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span></li><li data-sf-reveal="slide-up"><span class="landing-step-icon"><svg class="workspace-svg" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ws-check"/></svg></span><div><strong>Stay close to progress</strong><p>Follow published decisions and updates.</p></div><span class="landing-step-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span></li></ol>
 <p class="landing-journey-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Your perspective belongs here.</p>
</section>
